      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あ、師匠。\r\n魔法が使えるようになったので、\r\nさっそく怪我をしている人を回復魔法で治しています。",
        "official_en": "Oh, Mistress Sakura! Now that my powers are back, I’ve already been healing injured villagers.",
        "real_en": "Oh, Master. Now that I can use magic again,\r\nI’ve already started healing the injured."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
