        "jp_sha256": "b9890d82e1329619c73d030e6910874841d444f140c37ce99a7b5106397bb6f1",
        "official_en_sha256": "c9032b779accf913874fff77691deb21619e29297f6918f82322868a24aaa6de"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はあ……。\r\nお前というやつは……。\r\nそういうところがワシは苦手なんじゃよ。",
        "official_en": "Egads! Such insolence... ’Tis precisely the reason I find you wearisome.",
        "real_en": "Honestly... You really are something. That's the part of you I have trouble dealing with."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
