        "official_en_sha256": "09b76f47c31f6deed93ae34337e70e1ed91fe75420d39a794df7eb16a8ffcc97"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ワシがミシディアにこいと言えば、\r\nお前は一緒についてきたじゃろう。",
        "official_en": "Had I asked, you would have journeyed with me to Mysidia, without question.",
