      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "大事な弟子を危険な目に\r\n遭わすわけにはいかんからのう。",
        "official_en": "...And I could not live with myself if my valued apprentice came to harm.",
        "real_en": "I couldn't put my precious apprentice in danger."
